NAME

ulibStoreTodaysDate - Stores today's date in Xenolink format


SYNOPSIS

void ulibStoreTodaysDate(struct TimeDate *TDate)
                                   a0


DESCRIPTION

This function stores the current time and date in the Xenolink TimeDate
structure supplied.

NOTE:  The constant FIRST_YEAR must be added with the Year field of a TimeDate
       structure to obtain a year in the 19xx format.

       For a two digit year format, (FIRST_YEAR-1900) must be added with the
       Year field.
